; OP_PUSHDATA4 lengths with the top bit set must be read unsigned, like
; Core's GetScriptOp (ReadLE32), in every raw-script walker
; (psweep-camlcoin-ispushonly-pushdata4-signed-loop).  On the pre-fix tree a
; signed read made is_push_only_raw loop forever on `4e fb ff ff ff`, so each
; case runs in a forked child with a wall-clock bound and a hang is reported
; as that case's failure.  Own directory so the shared test/dune names list
; is untouched; uses only APIs that exist on the pre-fix tree.
(test
 (name test_ispushonly_pushdata4)
 (modules test_ispushonly_pushdata4)
 (libraries camlcoin test_tmp alcotest unix))
